&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben, unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um Chancengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;hier&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and helping enterprises unify data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. A leader in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato’s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato provides the trusted foundation for organizations to automate with confidence and operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the back of high customer demand and as part of our ongoing and successful Professional Services build out in EMEA, we are looking for an exceptional &lt;strong&gt;Technical Architect, &lt;/strong&gt;experienced in SAP projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In this role, y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;ou will also be responsible to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participating as a SAP integration SME and architect in professional services engagements, focused in particular but not only on integration and automation with SAP ecosystem (SAP ECC, S/4HANA, SaaS applications) as well as on migrations from other platforms to Workato&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working on customized customer onboarding, statements of work and other customer facing activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being a Workato evangelist with the ability to discover and demonstrate how Workato can effectively help companies with their business automation needs across a broad set of industries through professional services engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Becoming the trusted technical advisor to customers and partners from an overall solution, architecture and implementation perspective for the Workato platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributing to our global SAP practice by creating or enhancing content such as Workato Community content, reference demos and presentations,, white papers, best practices, architecture patterns, and online courses for use by customers, partners and Workato teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through professional services engagements, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead business requirements sessions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop architectural designs for customer integrations and automations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct recipe reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on unit, integration and user acceptance testing best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct production readiness assessments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on production deployment procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct post-live deployment health checks and guidance on recipe and process optimizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide thorough knowledge transfer to customer and partner teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply and advise on frameworks, such as Workato’s GEARS and Workato’s Embedded Product Guide, to align with customer organizations’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be embedded in customers’ organisations and rapidly understand and absorb their current business process and levers and advise on how they can be improved through automation, orchestration or adoption of other Workato platform features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of technology transformation consulting, including implementation experience with one or more common integration or middleware solutions and/or API management solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in end-to-end solution architecture and implementation on SAP PI/PO and SAP Integration Suite. Knowledge of SAP BC, SAP AIF, SAP iRPA and SAP BTP services (such as AI, SAP Build etc.) is beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of SAP interfacing technologies, configuration and troubleshooting&amp;nbsp; (IDoc, RFC, OData, SOAP WebServices etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SAP architecture, key SAP methodologies and frameworks (Clean Core, ISA-M etc.) Proven results leading and overseeing customer and/or partner success in the following domains: front-end and back-end solution architecture, enterprise architecture, development, and test/release management strategies, change management, and direct leadership in designing solutions that meet or exceed customer needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of security and governance needs for large corporations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to travel to the client site up to 25%, but may be higher or lower based on prevailing circumstances&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business English fluency (written and verbal)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience as an Enterprise and/or digital architect preferably in consulting engagements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Master’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of key applications such as Salesforce, Netsuite, Workday, ServiceNow,&amp;nbsp; EBusiness Suite, Database&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of AWS, Azure, GCP, and programming languages Ruby, ABAP, Java, Groovy, JS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience having worked in a global start-up environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SAP or other relevant certifications (AWS, Microsoft etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;German language knowledge B1 and higher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(REQ ID: 2820)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Berlin / Hamburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic and experienced Resource Manager to join our EMEA resourcing team for our Experience &amp;amp; Engineering DACH Team (Across Germany and Switzerland). This role is essential in ensuring efficient resource allocation, optimizing utilization, and aligning with business growth in a fast-paced digital environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for matching the right talent to the right projects - balancing team skills, availability, and project needs to deliver high-quality work, on time and on budget. This includes managing billable headcount, supporting dynamic staffing needs, and planning ahead with the Commercial team to align with the business pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of digital project delivery (e.g., websites, e-commerce, mobile apps) and the roles involved - such as UX/UI Design,Strategy, Engineers, QA, Devops, among others.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone with excellent people skills, an analytical mindset, and a proactive approach to team planning - someone who can help us operate with agility, elevate our talent, and support impactful client work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you’ll work in a creative, fast-moving environment alongside brilliant minds, for a wide range of global clients. We value curiosity, growth, and a drive to make a positive impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Planning &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the full resourcing lifecycle across Experience &amp;amp; Engineering requests for a pool of ~100 FTE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate capacity, utilization, and bandwidth to optimize allocation, balancing business needs with team wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make strategic resourcing decisions considering project margins, business priorities, and talent development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand Forecasting &amp;amp; Workforce Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Delivery, Finance and Operation during project intake to build effective staffing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain accurate short- and long-term demand forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify skill gaps and workforce needs, partnering with Craft Leads and People &amp;amp; Culture on hiring and training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Regional Resourcing &amp;amp; External Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate resourcing across EMEA, including nearshore and offshore teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and onboard freelancers or external partners when internal capacity is unavailable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a balanced approach between internal, nearshore/offshore, and freelance resourcing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key partner to Delivery, Sales, Operations, Project Managers, and Craft Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between resourcing strategies and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a consultative approach by advising on alternative profiles or staffing solutions based on project needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Conflict Resolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks in resourcing plans and implement mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and resolve resource conflicts, competing priorities, and overlapping demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting, Data &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high data quality within resource management tools (e.g., Resource Guru)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with processes such as time tracking, allocations, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on key metrics (utilization, capacity, bench, freelance/nearshore ratios)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular insights to local, regional, and global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;ll BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Resource Management, Engineering Resource Management, or Technical/Digital Project Management within a digital agency or product environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple markets and cultures (EMEA experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital &amp;amp; Technical Understanding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of digital roles (Backend, Frontend, DevOps, QA, Business Analysis, UX/UI, Project Management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of digital product delivery (web, e-commerce, mobile) and cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate project needs into effective staffing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and forecasting skills, with experience in reporting tools such as Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in resource management tools (Resource Guru experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to influence across teams and seniority levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and acting as a trusted advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with strong problem-solving and decision-making abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and process-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to prioritize effectively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, solution-oriented, and comfortable navigating complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, team-oriented, and hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, adaptable, and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, assertive and clear communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;ll GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working policy (1-2 days at the office, depending on location);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 personal monthly allowance via our dedicated benefits apps for use across daily expenses and lifestyle perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lease bike options / JobRad and 25% subsidy for the Deutschlandticket.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional breakfast/lunch at the office, Smoothie Tuesdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Bens - Exclusive access to sustainable, healthy products at attractive deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
